{"id":"1b392f99-423f-5792-8eee-4cc22d4f04c3","protocol_id":"0c5ca4a7-0e1f-4a52-9a0b-5c1c6c1f0a31","display_name":"Diaphragmatic breathing","item_type":"activity","kind":"action","category":"do","subtype":"wellness","group_name":"Breathwork and nervous-system exercises","scheduled_time":"07:11:00","duration_minutes":3,"day_number":7,"sort_order":30,"recurrence_type":"daily","recurrence_interval_unit":"day","catalog_activity_id":"activity_natmove_breathing","notes":"Hands on the lower ribs; breathe in gently and let them expand; exhale without forcing. Ongoing habit. This is an existing catalog activity; its full steps are on the activity.","hidden":false,"enabled":true,"has_children":false,"is_starter":false,"notifications_enabled":false},
{"id":"1ff30fd4-beb2-54dc-a8be-b1379c27ec5d","protocol_id":"0c5ca4a7-0e1f-4a52-9a0b-5c1c6c1f0a31","display_name":"Lateral Lunge with Reach","item_type":"activity","kind":"action","category":"do","subtype":"exercise","group_name":"1. Warm up (5 min)","scheduled_time":"07:04:00","duration_minutes":1,"day_number":10,"sort_order":30,"recurrence_type":"daily","recurrence_interval_unit":"day","catalog_activity_id":"activity_oscar_lateral_lunge_with_reach","notes":"Suggested complete session: a synthesis of lower-risk elements from the catalogue, not an exact routine published by Oscar. Dose: 10 reps (alternating sides).\n1. Take a wide step out to the side.\n2. Bend the stepping knee and shift your hips back, keeping the other leg comparatively straight.\n3. Reach diagonally or overhead without forcing your spine.\n4. Push back to standing and repeat on the other side.","hidden":false,"enabled":true,"has_children":false,"is_starter":false,"notifications_enabled":false},
{"id":"25ff94f9-4eee-5c14-8796-b59263703a2d","protocol_id":"0c5ca4a7-0e1f-4a52-9a0b-5c1c6c1f0a31","display_name":"Chin / mentalis taping","item_type":"activity","kind":"action","category":"do","subtype":"hygiene","group_name":"Facial taping and passive practices","duration_minutes":1,"day_number":9,"sort_order":30,"recurrence_type":"daily","recurrence_interval_unit":"day","catalog_activity_id":"activity_oscar_chin_mentalis_taping","notes":"Research-only, not for self-guided use. Described in Oscar's materials: Tape used around the chin during relaxation or sleep. Documented dose: not specified. Do not tape the mouth shut during sleep, especially with snoring, nasal obstruction or possible sleep apnea. Long-term facial reshaping through tape is not established.","hidden":true,"enabled":true,"has_children":false,"is_starter":false,"notifications_enabled":false},
{"id":"271270f4-c339-52c2-876a-427f754d2e0f","protocol_id":"0c5ca4a7-0e1f-4a52-9a0b-5c1c6c1f0a31","display_name":"Masseter Massage","item_type":"activity","kind":"action","category":"do","subtype":"hygiene","group_name":"Facial muscles and soft-tissue massage","scheduled_time":"07:07:00","duration_minutes":2,"day_number":5,"sort_order":30,"recurrence_type":"daily","recurrence_interval_unit":"day","catalog_activity_id":"activity_oscar_masseter_massage","notes":"Dose: 60 seconds.\n1. Find the cheek muscle near the angle of your jaw.\n2. Use small circular fingertip motions with light-to-moderate pressure.\n3. Repeat on the other side.","hidden":false,"enabled":true,"has_children":false,"is_starter":false,"notifications_enabled":false},
{"id":"390eefe0-31a0-5caf-8194-9416b69fb31b","protocol_id":"0c5ca4a7-0e1f-4a52-9a0b-5c1c6c1f0a31","display_name":"Back-of-Neck Isometric Press","item_type":"activity","kind":"action","category":"do","subtype":"exercise","group_name":"Neck training","scheduled_time":"07:08:00","duration_minutes":3,"day_number":6,"sort_order":30,"recurrence_type":"daily","recurrence_interval_unit":"day","catalog_activity_id":"activity_oscar_back_of_neck_isometric_press","notes":"Dose: Archive: 3 × 15–30 reps (face-down bench version); beginner form here is a 10-second isometric press.\n1. Sit or stand upright.\n2. Place both hands at the back of your head.\n3. Press the head gently backward into your hands without letting it move.\n4. Hold for about 10 seconds, then relax.","hidden":false,"enabled":true,"has_children":false,"is_starter":false,"notifications_enabled":false},
{"id":"7da9689e-1b01-5332-b6c3-e2f1ca79c335","protocol_id":"0c5ca4a7-0e1f-4a52-9a0b-5c1c6c1f0a31","display_name":"Lateral Lunge with Reach","item_type":"activity","kind":"action","category":"do","subtype":"exercise","group_name":"Full-body activation, spirals and twists","scheduled_time":"07:08:00","duration_minutes":3,"day_number":1,"sort_order":30,"recurrence_type":"daily","recurrence_interval_unit":"day","catalog_activity_id":"activity_oscar_lateral_lunge_with_reach","notes":"Dose: 10 reps (alternating sides).\n1. Take a wide step out to the side.\n2. Bend the stepping knee and shift your hips back, keeping the other leg comparatively straight.\n3. Reach diagonally or overhead without forcing your spine.\n4. Push back to standing and repeat on the other side.","hidden":false,"enabled":true,"has_children":false,"is_starter":false,"notifications_enabled":false},
