{"id":"b9992734-c915-5c46-a9cb-93bd9e7959d9","protocol_id":"0c5ca4a7-0e1f-4a52-9a0b-5c1c6c1f0a31","display_name":"Tongue Clicks","item_type":"activity","kind":"action","category":"do","subtype":"hygiene","group_name":"Tongue training, swallowing and chewing","scheduled_time":"07:05:00","duration_minutes":1,"day_number":4,"sort_order":30,"recurrence_type":"daily","recurrence_interval_unit":"day","catalog_activity_id":"activity_oscar_tongue_clicks","notes":"Dose: Not specified.\n1. Open the mouth slightly.\n2. Press the whole tongue against the roof of the mouth.\n3. Form a light suction.\n4. Release the tongue quickly to make a click.\n5. Repeat while keeping the jaw relaxed.","hidden":false,"enabled":true,"has_children":false,"is_starter":false,"notifications_enabled":false},
{"id":"d2571f4d-4be2-5868-b72e-55a3e7e4053a","protocol_id":"0c5ca4a7-0e1f-4a52-9a0b-5c1c6c1f0a31","display_name":"Hamstring Release","item_type":"activity","kind":"action","category":"do","subtype":"exercise","group_name":"Foot, lower-body and fascia release","scheduled_time":"07:06:00","duration_minutes":2,"day_number":2,"sort_order":30,"recurrence_type":"daily","recurrence_interval_unit":"day","catalog_activity_id":"activity_oscar_hamstring_release","notes":"Dose: 30 seconds per side.\n1. Sit with the roller under your thigh and support yourself with your hands.\n2. Roll from just above the knee toward the glute fold, avoiding the back of the knee.\n3. Repeat with the other leg.","hidden":false,"enabled":true,"has_children":false,"is_starter":false,"notifications_enabled":false},
{"id":"f28206e1-8dda-5595-b4e1-d11a6eda3c79","protocol_id":"0c5ca4a7-0e1f-4a52-9a0b-5c1c6c1f0a31","display_name":"Thumbpulling follow-up","item_type":"activity","kind":"action","category":"do","subtype":"hygiene","group_name":"Cranial and palate techniques (research-only)","duration_minutes":2,"day_number":8,"sort_order":30,"recurrence_type":"daily","recurrence_interval_unit":"day","catalog_activity_id":"activity_oscar_thumbpulling_follow_up","notes":"Research-only, not for self-guided use. Described in Oscar's materials: Changing head or body position while keeping thumb pressure on the palate. Documented dose: 3–4 sets per direction. Same risks as thumbpulling: forceful manual palate pressure is not an established treatment.","hidden":true,"enabled":true,"has_children":false,"is_starter":false,"notifications_enabled":false},
{"id":"3343246f-685e-56a8-8f5a-692fc10f2f5e","protocol_id":"0c5ca4a7-0e1f-4a52-9a0b-5c1c6c1f0a31","display_name":"Fascia Pulling (thumb-on-palate version)","item_type":"activity","kind":"action","category":"do","subtype":"hygiene","group_name":"Cranial and palate techniques (research-only)","duration_minutes":2,"day_number":8,"sort_order":40,"recurrence_type":"daily","recurrence_interval_unit":"day","catalog_activity_id":"activity_oscar_fascia_pulling_thumb_on_palate_version","notes":"Research-only, not for self-guided use. Described in Oscar's materials: Oscar's website: lunge with the back heel lifted, thumb on the palate, then a head-spine-hips twist and back-heel pivot. The hands-free twist is #4.. Documented dose: Hold a few seconds before rotating; no verified total count. The palate-thumb part is forceful manual pressure and is not an established treatment. The hands-free lunge twist is offered separately as #4.","hidden":true,"enabled":true,"has_children":false,"is_starter":false,"notifications_enabled":false},
{"id":"3cd88f47-b3c4-5d11-b555-c0ce2ab80a4e","protocol_id":"0c5ca4a7-0e1f-4a52-9a0b-5c1c6c1f0a31","display_name":"Glute Release","item_type":"activity","kind":"action","category":"do","subtype":"exercise","group_name":"Foot, lower-body and fascia release","scheduled_time":"07:09:00","duration_minutes":2,"day_number":2,"sort_order":40,"recurrence_type":"daily","recurrence_interval_unit":"day","catalog_activity_id":"activity_oscar_glute_release","notes":"Dose: 30 seconds per side.\n1. Sit on the ball or roller and lean toward one hip.\n2. Make small, slow movements across the glute muscles.\n3. Repeat on the other hip.","hidden":false,"enabled":true,"has_children":false,"is_starter":false,"notifications_enabled":false},
